						<div class="fl-row-content fl-row-full-width fl-node-content">
		
<div class="fl-col-group fl-node-615c75ec46d0e fl-col-group-equal-height fl-col-group-align-center" data-node="615c75ec46d0e">
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-615c75ec46d11 fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small fl-col-has-cols" data-node="615c75ec46d11">
	<div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><h2  class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text fl-node-615c75ec46d13" data-node="615c75ec46d13">
			Experience SUNY Sullivan	</h2>
<div  class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text fl-node-615c75ec46d14" data-node="615c75ec46d14">
	<p>SUNY Sullivan is a forward-looking, top-tier community college in New York offering over 40 degree programs, certificates, and micro-credentials for learners at all levels of their educational goals. Our 405-acre campus provides a living sustainability lab with an organic farm, geothermal heating and cooling, solar farm, wind turbine, and apiary. We are committed to environmental and social responsibility that informs our campus operations and curriculum. Whether from an urban environment or local hometown, our students benefit from our mindbody wellness initiatives and excel in championship Division II Athletics programs.</p>
</div>
<div class="fl-module fl-module-button fl-node-615c75ec46d15 fl-button-wrap fl-button-width-auto fl-button-left" data-node="615c75ec46d15"><a href="https://my.sunysullivan.edu/ICS/Getting_Started/Apply_Now.jnz?portlet=Apply_Online_20&#038;screen=Begin%2f%2f1d7697d5-35a7-4586-b674-07f9d976d72d&#038;screenType=next" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="fl-button"><span class="fl-button-text">APPLY TODAY!</span></a></div>
<div class="fl-col-group fl-node-615c75ec46d16 fl-col-group-nested" data-node="615c75ec46d16">
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-615c75ec46d17 fl-col-bg-color" data-node="615c75ec46d17">
	<div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><figure class="fl-module fl-module-photo fl-photo fl-photo-align-center fl-node-615c75ec46d18" data-node="615c75ec46d18" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject">
	<div class="fl-photo-content fl-photo-img-png">
					<img decoding="async" class="fl-photo-img wp-image-704 size-full lazyload" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAA+gAAAE+AQMAAAAklai8AAAABlBMVEUAAAD///+l2Z/dAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAD5JREFUeNrtwTEBAAAAwqD1T20JT6AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAICnAZyEAAFdiHV4AAAAAElFTkSuQmCC" alt="sun" height="318" width="1000" title="sun" loading="lazy" data-src="https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun.png" data-srcset="https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun.png 1000w, https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun-300x95.png 300w, https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun-768x244.png 768w" data-max-width="1000" data-sizes="auto" data-eio-rwidth="1000" data-eio-rheight="318" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="fl-photo-img wp-image-704 size-full" src="https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun.png" alt="sun" height="318" width="1000" title="sun" loading="lazy" srcset="https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun.png 1000w, https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun-300x95.png 300w, https://sunysullivan.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/sun-768x244.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" data-eio="l" /></noscript>
					</div>
	</figure>
</div>
</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
			<div class="fl-col fl-node-615c75ec46d12 fl-col-bg-photo fl-col-has-cols fl-col-bg-overlay fl-col-bg-fixed" data-node="615c75ec46d12">
	<div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><figure class="fl-module fl-module-photo fl-photo fl-photo-align-center fl-node-615c75ec46d19" data-node="615c75ec46d19" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject">
